          danger ? 'End' : label,
          style: TextStyle(fontSize: 12, color: colors.fg2, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500),
        ),
      ],
    );
  }

  Widget _buildQualityBadge(LumioColors colors, bool isDark) {
    Color qColor;
